## Enable Ubuntu Package Repositories

In addition to the OpenHPC package repository, the *head node* also requires
access to the standard Ubuntu repositories in order to resolve base operating
system dependencies. This recipe assumes a standard {{ distro_full_name }}
installation with the `main`, `universe`, and `multiverse` components enabled.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Enable Ubuntu package repositories -->
```bash
export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive
apt-get update
apt-get -y install \
	ca-certificates curl gnupg software-properties-common
add-apt-repository -y universe
add-apt-repository -y multiverse
apt-get update
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
